onfirm that each arm\n   used only allowed predecessor state and that exact outcomes appear only\n   after the corresponding durable prompt and completion.\n4. Replay journal prepare, commit, abort, and rollback transitions into a\n   temporary in-memory store. Compare each state hash and final hash with\n   Exp6978. Do not repair discrepancies.\n5. Recompute arm budgets, per-event exact success, chronological gain,\n   plasticity, stability, maximum forgetting, state bytes, and all\n   confidence intervals directly from rows.\n6. Re-evaluate the positive gate exactly: at least two held-future gains over\n   read-only, zero lost read-only successes, rollback pass, no leakage, and\n   state budget pass. Record every term and source disagreement.\n7. Set self_learning_audit_complete_score=1 when all rows and states replay.\n   Set learning_safety_confirmed_score=1 only when hashes, chronology,\n   leakage, rollback, budgets, and headline arithmetic agree. Do not turn a\n   reproduced null into a positive result.\n8. Run focused tests, Ruff, OpenSpec coverage, artifact validation,\n   adversarial verification, row-consistency lint, and root-clutter checks.\n9. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles with one scientific\n   principle per required field and both self_learning_audit_complete_score\n   and learning_safety_confirmed_score; preconditions_checked;\n   inference_substrate (fresh_process_readonly_transaction_replay);\n   duration_s; source_artifact_hashes; rows; per_event_results;\n   visibility_replay_rows; journal_replay_rows; state_hash_rows;\n   budget_recomputation_rows; metric_recomputation_rows;\n   positive_gate_recomputation; source_disagreement_rows;\n   leakage_audit_rows; rollback_audit_rows; read_only_enforcement_receipt;\n   self_learning_audit_complete_score; learning_safety_confirmed_score;\n   random_seed; reproducibility_checksum; gate_check_summary with failed\n   check, expected value, and observed value for any blocked verdict;\n   verifier_is_oracle (false); verdict_class\n   (positive | circular_positive | null | blocked | disqualified | partial);\n   honest_verdict with a terminal prefix consistent with verdict_class.\n\nRun command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6979_self_learning_cold_audit.py --date {date}\nDo NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.\n",
